KA pathway during sperm motility and sperm capacitation (By similarity). May play a role in sperm tail differentiation and motility and hence male fertility (By similarity)."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_04","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}